WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:03,000
Qinzhou, you kid is a tea cake every year

2
00:00:03,000 --> 00:00:04,600
I don’t know if I should change it.

3
00:00:04,600 --> 00:00:06,600
Grandpa, you love tea

4
00:00:06,600 --> 00:00:08,600
Of course I have to make a good deal.

5
00:00:08,600 --> 00:00:10,600
You can also get this kind of gift

6
00:00:10,600 --> 00:00:12,600
If you don’t want to send it, you don’t have to send it.

7
00:00:12,600 --> 00:00:15,000
There's no need to mess with me with things that can't fit on the table.

8
00:00:15,000 --> 00:00:16,800
This is too perfunctory

9
00:00:16,800 --> 00:00:18,200
Filial piety comes first

10
00:00:18,200 --> 00:00:20,200
We have always been filial to our family

11
00:00:20,200 --> 00:00:22,400
Yoyo, if you haven’t learned this truth

12
00:00:22,400 --> 00:00:24,400
You have to remember what I said today

13
00:00:24,400 --> 00:00:28,150
What did grandparents say to encourage Gulu?

14
00:00:28,150 --> 00:00:30,150
Can't understand Si riddles

15
00:00:30,580 --> 00:00:31,580
You're still pretending to be stupid

16
00:00:31,580 --> 00:00:33,580
Isn't this gift from you?

17
00:00:33,580 --> 00:00:42,020
Still lying

18
00:00:42,020 --> 00:00:45,210
Grandma Youyou is so disappointed in you

19
00:00:45,210 --> 00:00:47,210
Grandpa no matter what

20
00:00:47,210 --> 00:00:49,210
This is also a thought

21
00:00:49,210 --> 00:00:51,210
There's no need for you to be so angry, right?

22
00:00:51,210 --> 00:00:53,210
Even you come to make me angry

23
00:00:53,210 --> 00:00:55,210
One or two, they are really my great grandchildren.

24
00:00:55,210 --> 00:01:06,530
This Jiaojiao doesn’t want to give autumn to grandpa

25
00:01:07,530 --> 00:01:09,590
Jiaojiao, don’t cry

26
00:01:09,590 --> 00:01:11,590
Old man, you see what happened?
